From ba063585c402791213189bf10a754de2280d9146 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 06:31:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add per-day goal overrides for streak makeup

Past days in the last-7 window can be forced met/missed via
day_goal_overrides; streak and last7Days treat overrides as
authoritative. Today stays locked to live logs. Widen log fetch
to cover the visible week before challenge start.
